---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — SEE GPA Calculator | Seepapers.com';
const description =
  'Privacy Policy for the SEE GPA Calculator on tools.seepapers.com. Learn what data we collect, how analytics and ads work, and how your marks stay private in your browser.';

const email = 'contact@seepapers.com';
const updated = 'June 24, 2026';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical="/privacy-policy">
  <Header />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6 text-sm text-mute">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span> Privacy Policy
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-mute">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how <strong class="text-ink">tools.seepapers.com</strong> ("we", "us", "our"),
        operated by Seepapers.com, handles information when you use the SEE GPA Calculator. We respect your privacy and
        keep data collection to a minimum.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">1. Your marks stay in your browser</h2>
      <p>
        The grades and marks you enter into the calculator, planner, eligibility checker and marksheet generator are
        processed entirely in your browser. We do <strong class="text-ink">not</strong> upload, transmit or store your
        academic data on our servers. When you close or refresh the page, that data is gone unless your browser keeps
        it locally.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">2. Local storage</h2>
      <p>
        We use your browser's local storage only to remember small preferences, such as your light or dark theme
        choice. This stays on your device and is never sent to us.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">3. Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site (for example, which tools are most popular and
        which pages are visited). Google Analytics may set cookies and collect anonymised data such as your device
        type, approximate location and pages viewed. This helps us improve the tool. You can read
        <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
          class="see-link"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a
        > for details.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">4. Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We may display advertising, including through Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use
        cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this and other websites. You can manage personalised
        advertising through
        <a
          href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads"
          class="see-link"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small files stored on your device. We and our partners (analytics and advertising) may use them as
        described above. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though some features may not work as
        intended.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">6. Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This tool is designed for Class 10 students. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        Because we do not require sign-up or collect your name or contact details, no personal academic profile is
        ever created.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">7. External links</h2>
      <p>
        Our site links to Seepapers.com and other resources. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those
        external sites; please review their own policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">8. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above shows when it was last
        revised. Continued use of the site means you accept the current version.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Email us at
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="see-link">{email}</a> or use our
        <a href="/contact-us" class="see-link">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .see-link {
    color: #7928ca;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .see-link:hover { color: #007cf0; }
  :global(.dark) .see-link { color: #b388ff; }
</style>
